WEBVTT

00:00:05.198 --> 00:00:09.885
Choose Site settings in the side menu.

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:13.856
Click Features and limits.

00:00:14.106 --> 00:00:19.115
Scroll to Raw view event retention (days).

00:00:19.365 --> 00:00:24.133
Scroll to Audit log retention (months).

00:00:24.383 --> 00:00:28.716
Click Pages.
